Modifications in this fork add the Micro Rooster robot:
  - src/mjlab_microduck/robot/microrooster/ (model generator and generated MJCF)
  - src/mjlab_microduck/robot/microrooster_constants.py
  - src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/microrooster_velocity_env_cfg.py
  - RateLimitedTargetBamActuator in src/mjlab_microduck/actuator/friction_dr_bam.py
  - head-joint handling in src/mjlab_microduck/tasks/mdp.py
  - scripts/view_rooster.py, README.md (upstream README moved to docs/microduck.md)

The Micro Rooster model is derived from the Microduck 3D model files, which
are licensed under Creative Commons BY-NC-SA by Pollen Robotics; the derived
model files are distributed under the same terms.
